  "bio": "Mariana Müllenmester is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Xangri-Lá, Brazil, renowned for her intricate dotwork tattoos. Her dedication to cleanliness is evident in every aspect of her work, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for all her clients. Whether you're looking for a stunning dotwork piece or just a clean and professional tattoo experience, Mariana is the artist to trust.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Xangri-lá, Rio Grande Do Sul, Brazil"
